        "id": 5735,
        "name": "Greonhal",
        "username": "Greonhal",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-05T11:03:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In one game, I managed to get Cat Fight, Fight The Break Of Dawn, Lethal At Eight Months, and Down But Not Out.</p>\n<p>It took two tries to bring Citizen Dawn down. The first time, her opening Citizens were Anvil, Hammer, and Spring. Then on her turn, the card she flipped was Citizen Truth. I conceded right then and there. Redeal, and again she got an early Hammer and Spring, but no Anvil or Truth. So, first turn, Visionary Wrested Hammer’s Mind. Then her next turn, Visionary entered a Telekinetic Cocoon. In which she laughed. She laughed merrily.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:28.195Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
