        "id": 29680,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-06T12:54:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wouldn’t that kill Hammer the first time he dealt damage?  I can see laughing if Citizen Truth was in play.  That would be a fun way to kill off Truth.</p>\n<p>I started one game with Citizen Blood, Citizen Sweat, Citizen Tears, Blinding Blast.  Turn one, no hands, and no prospect for any.  Haka and Ra were able to take down Tears on the second turn, thanking their innate powers.  I think we actually came back to win it.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
